        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe bambeija ba Bashani, muhulire ekigambo eki, inywe bambeija b'omw'ibanga lya Samaria. Inywe abalikushasa abanaku, nimubonesa abajege enaku zibi, nimugambira baibainywe muti, “Mulete eby'okunywa tunywe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama Ruhanga arahiire najuliza obutakatifubwe ati, “Ebiro bilija orwo balibatwaza amarobo; inywena mulishusha enfuru ekwetwe eirobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balibarabya omu bika by'eboma muhonderaine, babanage Harimoni.” Alikugamba Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukama nagamba ati, “Mwije Betheli mufakare; mwije Giligali mukore entamabara ezishagireho. Mulete ebitambo byanyu buli bwankya, kandi buli biro bishatu mulete ekichweka kya ikumi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muhonge ekitambo ky'esimi ekina eitumbyo, n'ebihongo byanyu eby'obweyendezi ebyo mulikugira mubigambe, kuba inywe Baisiraeli ebyo nibyo mwenda kukora.” Alikugamba Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nkabeza amaisho omu bigo byanyu byona, hona mbali mwaturaga mwaburwa ekyakulya, kyonkai na honene aho timwangarukiire.” Alikugamba Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nashuba nabaima enjura emyezi eshatu orwo emyaka yomwabaire mulimire yabaire ekyagyetaga. Nkaba ningwisa enjura omu kigo kimoi, ekigo ekindi ningikiima. Musiri ogu gwakuboine enjura, ogwo etagwiremu gwoma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kityo ab'ebigo bibili anga bishatu bagyaga omu kigo kimoi kunywamu amaizi kyonkai tibalihuukaga. Na honene aho kutyo timwangarukiire.” Alikugamba Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Emyaka yanyu nkagiteza obukuku, ebusitani zanyu z'emizabibu nazita, emiti yanyu y'emizeituni yalibwa enzige. Kyonkai na honene aho timwangarukiire.” Alikugamba Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nabateza ekibundo nk'ekyo nateize Misiri; abasigazi banyu nabaleka bagwa omu ndashana; efarasi zanyu nazitwara; orusisira rwanyu rwabanukira kubi, kyonkai timwangarukiire.” Alikugamba Mukama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ebigo byanyu ebindi nkabijumika nk'okwo najumikire Sodoma na Gomora, mwashusha ekichumukulira ekichumukwirwe omu muliro. Na honene aho timwangarukiire.” Alikugamba Mukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "AMO 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aha rw'ekyo, iwe Isiraeli, nikwo ndikugira ntyo. Isiraeli, oyetekateke tubonangane; ndikugira ntyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "AMO.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "AMO.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
